OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry
OL,6,Fevening is expected, with clear spells
OL,7,Fdeveloping in between patchy cloud,
OL,8,Fallowing some mist, fog and frost
OL,9,Fpatches to develop during the night.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTuesday:FAreas of fog will be slow to
OL,12,Fclear on Tuesday morning, but sunny
OL,13,Fspells will slowly develop through the
OL,14,Fday.
